?INCLUDE 'av70_crawlspace'
av70_crawlspace.dialogstring_06D66C! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]The entrance is small;[N]you can't pass though![END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_kara'
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D2FF! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][SFX:10]Will: A picture of Kara.[N]Has she been absorbed[N]into this…?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_ishtar'
av74_ishtar.dialogstring_06CEF2! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Ishtar: You came for the[N]girl, didn't you? Kara,[N]was it?[WAI][N]Then pass through the[N]rooms ahead.[WAI][N]Solve each mystery, and I[N]will show you how to[N]restore her.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_apprentice'
av75_apprentice.dialogstring_06DC97! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]Ishtar's apprentice: You[N]may pass once you solve[N]the puzzle in the room[N]before you.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_voice_doors'
av75_voice_doors.dialogstring_06D83E! `[DEF]Ishtar's voice echoes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Patience. Open the doors[N]in order, beginning with[N]the one on the left.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_voice_rooms'
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DA14! `[DEF]Ishtar's voice echoes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Study this room carefully.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]When you believe you have[N]memorized every detail,[N]leave it behind.[END]`
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DA6B! `[DEF]Ishtar's voice echoes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Find what differs from the[N]room you saw before.[END]`
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DAF0! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Correct![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]You noticed the jar was a[N]different color.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Very good. Continue to the[N]next room.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_voice_doors'
av75_voice_doors.dialogstring_06D87B! `[DEF]Ishtar's voice echoes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]That door has already been[N]opened. There's no need to[N]open it again.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av75_voice_rooms'
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DB2C! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]That's correct![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Very good. You may advance[N]to the next room.[END]`
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DB4F! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]That's correct!![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]You've realized that the[N]treasure chest's contents[N]are different, haven't[N]you.[FIN]Very good.[N]You may advance to the[N]next room.[END]`
av75_voice_rooms.dialogstring_06DB9F! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]That's correct!![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Your hair was fluttering[N]because the wind was[N]blowing, wasn't it.[FIN]You have passed my tests[N]splendidly. Alright, you[N]may return.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_ishtar'
av74_ishtar.dialogstring_06CF5E! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Ishtar: I had been[N]waiting for you to come.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]You should sprinkle this[N]magic powder over the[N]picture of that girl, then[N]give it a heartfelt kiss.[FIN]Something should happen if[N]you truly feel for that[N]girl.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Well, you'll probably[N]understand eventually.[FIN]I painted my own[N]self-portrait.[FIN]I will soon be assimilated[N]into the picture…[FIN]That girl…[N]Protect her carefully…[END]`
av74_ishtar.dialogstring_06D039! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_kara'
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D278! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](First I need to use the[N]Magic Powder[AD])[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_0393C5! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]Tried using the magic[N]powder.[FIN]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_0393EA! `But nothing happened![END]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_0393FA! `Sprinkled the magic powder[N]on the picture of Kara![END]`

?INCLUDE 'av74_kara'
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D2A4! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: I'm begging you.[N]Kara… Please return to[N]your original form…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]Will placed a heartfelt[N]kiss on Kara's picture…[END]`
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D339! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Will… I'm sorry for[N]being selfish…[FIN]`
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D364! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: Agh, you've been[N]terrible…! You've been[N]incredibly bad…!![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Are you so irresponsible[N]that you're willing to[N]cause trouble for other[N]people…!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: …[END]`
av74_kara.dialogstring_06D3CC! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Waaaaaaaaaaah![N]*Sob*… *Sniff*…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]I… *Sob* I don't even[N]know… why I'm doing it[N]myself… *Sniff*…[FIN]The thing is, when I was[N]in the castle… I got[N]everything that I wanted…[FIN]But since I've been on[N]this journey, it's been[N]totally different…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: Isn't it obvious…!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]When you're only thinking[N]of yourself, you're in[N]trouble when things get[N]serious…!![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: That's not it…![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Even when you're far away,[N]I feel that you're close.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]And even when you're close[N]to me I feel that you're[N]far away…[FIN]If you don't understand,[N]that's fine…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]But I don't think I'll[N]forget what happened[N]today for the rest of my[N]life…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_erik'
av6A_erik.dialogstring_06C568! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Kara![N]I was worried…!![FIN][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Why do you always[N]run around by yourself…!?[FIN]Don't you have any concern[N]for anyone else…!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: If you're talking[N]about that, Will already[N]scolded me.[FIN]Because of that, I[N]sincerely apologize to[N]everyone…! *Bow*…[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Well, it seems that[N]even the perpetrator[N]understands the matter,[N]so I can tolerate it.[FIN]Anyway, it seems that if[N]we proceed about three[N]days to the south, you get[N]to the Floating City.[FIN]I think we'll try to[N]leave right away. Talk to[N]me when you're prepared[N]to leave.[END]`
av6A_erik.dialogstring_06C6A0! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Ah, speaking of[N]that…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]In the fallen angels'[N]village, I noticed[N]something that looked[N]like a Red Jewel.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_lily'
av6A_lily.dialogstring_06C2F8! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Kara is acting[N]strange, isn't she?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]I have a sense for these[N]things. Did something[N]happen between you two?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_lance'
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BFBE! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Looks like Lilly's[N]birthday will come while[N]we're in the Floatin'[N]City[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_kara'
av6A_kara.dialogstring_06C417! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: They say Watermia[N]is built from houses[N]floating on rafts.[WAI][N]Doesn't that sound[N]romantic? I think it'll[N]be fun.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_neil'
av6A_neil.dialogstring_06C10D! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Is it okay to go?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] Wait a bit[PAL:4]`
av6A_neil.dialogstring_06C136! `[CLR]Neil: Don't rush things.[N]Take your time finishing[N]your business.[END]`
av6A_neil.dialogstring_06C15C! `[CLR]Neil: It seems that the[N]Floating City is a[N]considerably hot place.[FIN]Everyone mustn't get[N]heatstroke, so take care.[END]`
